+# Patch 0017: variation picker as a grid sub-page, Lock POS, Price check, Stock check
+
+Items: A14.2, A15.1, A15.2, A15.3. Status key: `[x]` code-complete and tested in my sandbox (pure logic + `tsc`), `[ ]` needs your iPad.
+
+## Plan, in the order it was done
+
+1. [x] **Read the current state.** Cloned `main` (head `c08023f`, patches up to 0016). `PROGRESS.md` and `DEV_NOTES.md` re-read. Baseline: `npm test` 179 pass, `tsc --noEmit` clean (Zeller SDK stubbed out, as before).
+2. [x] **Pure rules first** (`src/lib/lookup.ts`, `src/lib/posLock.ts`), so they are testable without React Native:
+   - `resolveScan` / `scanProblem`: a barcode or SKU wins; otherwise a cashier pass or gift QR gets a specific message; otherwise "No item".
+   - `stockCheck`: scanned variation first, siblings after, no duplicates, other products ignored, total of tracked stock (negatives count as 0), untracked count, `single` for plain items.
+   - `dealsFor` / `priceCheck`: live automatic discounts (date window, basic and buy-X-get-Y targets incl. collections) and live bundle deals (product id in a set matches all its variations, variant id only that one, same rule as `matchBundles`); `no-discount` items get none; "was" price only when compare-at is higher.
+   - `searchVariants`: every word must match, one row per product, capped at 30.
+   - `pickerCrumbs` / `pickerTitle` / `pickerVariants` for the picker.
+   - `lockDecision` / `isLockScreen`: needs staff, not mid card payment, not already locked.
+3. [x] **Grid model** (`src/lib/grid.ts`): added actions `lock_pos`, `price_check`, `stock_check` (labels, and they are in `ACTIONS` so Add tile lists them and new default layouts get them). Old layouts load unchanged.
+4. [x] **Variation picker** (`src/screens/Tiles.tsx`, `src/screens/Checkout.tsx`):
+   - `useTileSize()` extracted so grid and picker tiles line up; `VariantPicker` draws one tile per variation.
+   - Checkout: the old `Sheet` popup removed. In Quick Menu the picker replaces the grid and the breadcrumb ends with the product; in All products it replaces the list. Back arrow / crumbs close it. Tab, page, path or edit-mode change closes it. The Bluetooth scanner stays enabled (no modal any more).
+5. [x] **Lock POS**: `lockNow()` in `staffAuth.ts` (checks, locks, logs). `App.tsx` and the screensaver now use `isLockScreen` (staff exist + nobody signed in) instead of "Require PIN", so the tile works either way.
+6. [x] **Price / Stock check** (`src/screens/Lookup.tsx`): one sheet, two modes; Bluetooth scanner active while open, camera button, search box; result card; latest scan replaces the result.
+7. [x] **Tests** `tests/lookup.test.ts` (16). Mutation-checked: removing scanned-first ordering, the payment rule, or the no-discount rule each makes a test fail.
+8. [x] **Docs**: `docs/PROGRESS.md` (patch log, A14.2, A15, N15, notes), `docs/GRID.md`, this file.
+9. [ ] **You:** device test, see A15.4 in `PROGRESS.md`.
+
+## Decisions I made (tell me if you want any changed)
+
+- Lock POS works without "Require PIN". Before, the lock screen only existed when that setting was on, so the tile would have done nothing for you otherwise. Startup behaviour is unchanged (it only starts locked when Require PIN is on).
+- Price check shows deals as a hint list rather than a computed price, because the real price depends on what else is in the cart.
+- Existing grid layouts do not get the new tiles automatically (I would be rewriting a layout you edited). Add them from Add tile > Actions.
